0.2 62.2 79.4 79.4 86.2 93.7 100.4 100.4 113.2 120.0 129.0 129.0 139.4 139.4 146.2 155.2 155.2 162.0 162.0 162.0 168.7 176.2 192.0 202.4 209.2 230.2 237.0\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 30.0 30.0 54.7 62.2 86.2 113.2 192.0 202.4 209.2 237.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » bak). <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"277\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 277.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 31.4 31.4 38.2 45.0 63.0 63.0 69.7 69.7 69.7 76.4 84.0 99.7 108.7 120.0 135.7 146.2 154.4 154.4 162.0 162.0 173.2 173.2 182.2 198.0 219.0 219.0 225.7 232.4 239.2 239.2 246.0 252.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 38.2 45.0 99.7 108.7 135.7 182.2 202.4 232.4 246.0 252.7 261.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Şunlar da diğer bir takım en'âmdır, dediler ki bunlar üzerine Allâhın ismini zikretmezler.- Putları namına keserler veya üzerinde hacce gitmez, «lebbeykâllahümme» demezlerdi.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 112.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 30.0 36.7 54.7 54.7 61.4 61.4 68.3 75.7 75.7 82.4 82.4 89.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 36.7 68.3 96.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Hep bu hukümleri, bu taksimi Allaha iftira ederek uydurdular<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"233\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 233.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 